  "pushes {#}, collisions ×{#}": "empujes {#}, choques ×{#}", "a hero who didn't attack on their turn loses {#}%": "un héroe que no atacó en su turno pierde un {#} %", "Bonus": "Bonus", "Drawback": "Penalización",
  "Prowler": "Merodeador", "Archer": "Arquero", "Brute": "Bruto", "Gunner": "Artillero", "Crawling Bomb": "Bomba reptante", "Shaman": "Chamán", "Specter": "Espectro", "Summoner": "Invocador", "Splitter": "Escisíparo",
